# A search for a quality may find nothing (CR 701.23b): Bot1 accepts the "may", a Forest (a legal find) is in the library,
# and takes nothing. Nothing is revealed (no Revealed key), the hand stays as it was and the library keeps its 11 cards.
# (Unlike declining, the search was done, so the library is shuffled; the engine records no shuffle for a script to
# check, so only the first scenario's order, unshuffled when declined, is asserted.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Forest
Environmental Scientist
Island
Plains
Mountain
Island
Forest
Swamp
Taiga
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Plains x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Environmental Scientist.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search()
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Hand = Island; Plains; Mountain; Island
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Emerald; Forest; Environmental Scientist
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
